# .devbin/

Devbin framework installation for Riffle, containing the sealed-gate test runner, command resolution engine, and CLI documentation. Manifest.sha256 tracks file ownership to detect edits and prevent overwrites during devbin upgrade.

## Dirs

- `help/` -- CLI documentation and help guides
- `lib/` -- Shell library components: helpers, builtins, config parsing, command resolution, and sealed-gate runner

## Files

- `config.yaml` -- Project configuration declaring supported languages and devbin version constraint
- `manifest.sha256` -- Devbin ownership manifest; checksums all owned files to detect edits
